        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Mononuclear Dy(III) complex shows χMT = 13.98 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K (0.1 T), decreasing to 9.40 cm3 K mol−1 at 1.8 K. Zero-field ac data show frequency-dependent χM″ tails below ~10 K from QTM. Under 0.1 T dc field, fully visible χM″ peaks give Ueff = 10.9(1) K and τ0 = 1.9(1)×10−6 s. Magnetization at high field (~5 NμB) is below the free-ion limit, indicating anisotropy.",
